{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c6fb","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b1a1-0fcd-7b72-b1bb-a101f0623221"},"sequence":472,"recorded_at":1780531400000939,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"96b9aaba-3389-40b6-a064-cffa078aa95e","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"96b9aaba-3389-40b6-a064-cffa078aa95e","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"96b9aaba-3389-40b6-a064-cffa078aa95e"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b1a2-19f1-73b3-a050-d322d284e9e5"},"task_id":"01a0b1a2-19f1-73b3-a050-d322d284e9e5","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b1a2-19f1-73b3-a050-d322d284e9e5","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-1cyj0q/worktree/internal/clonebundle/testdata/mutant_harness.py`.\n1|#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2|\"\"\"Narrowing-mutant harness for internal/clonebundle.\n3|\n4|Every gate ships a narrowing mutant: the gate stays present and is\n5|weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and\n6|the named killer test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that\n7|the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\n8|\n9|Each row runs M (mutate one production file in place), R (run the\n10|scoped Go killer through the production entry point), V (verdict from\n11|the Go exit code plus a FAIL kill-line: KILLED iff R fails with a test\n12|failure line, SURVIVED iff R passes, ERROR for anything else —\n13|unapplied patches, build breaks, timeouts). M failures and R\n14|infrastructure errors are ERROR, never kills or survivals. The file is\n15|restored from its backup after every row, pass or fail.\n16|\n17|Row C-doc-comment is the harmless control: a comment-only edit that\n18|must SURVIVE, proving the harness observes test outcomes instead of\n19|hard-coding kills.\n20|\n21|Usage:\n22|  PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/clonebundle/testdata/mutant_harness.py [--log-dir DIR] [MUTANT ...]\n23|\"\"\"\n24|\n25|import shutil\n26|import subprocess\n27|import sys\n28|import tempfile\n29|import time\n30|from dataclasses import dataclass\n31|from pathlib import Path\n32|\n33|REPO = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[3]\n34|PACKAGE = \"internal/clonebundle\"\n35|\n36|FORGED_DESCRIPTOR_HEX = \"edb3da2954b883ebc2099da18edeac4e12f8f5d67aa5bb2dd80ba472b23481f2\"\n37|OTHER_DESCRIPTOR_HEX = \"369c0225affac23e2a7a16052d03b24bfd9421ea3f83c8fe39111e864c344cfb\"\n38|PAIR_DIGEST = \"sha256:305e10453577c8371cdb872e120f1662649d150bbc2eff62b81827851f1d4926\"\n39|\n40|\n41|@dataclass(frozen=True)\n42|class Mutant:\n43|    name: str\n44|    path: str\n45|    find: str\n46|    replace: str\n47|    count: int\n48|    run: str\n49|    expect: str\n50|    note: str\n51|\n52|\n53|MUTANTS = [\n54|    Mutant(\n55|        name=\"N-raw-class\",\n56|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/rawmanifest.go\",\n57|        find='\\t\"derived_cache_optional\",\\n\\t\"unknown\",\\n',\n58|        replace='\\t\"derived_cache_optional\",\\n\\t\"credential\",\\n\\t\"unknown\",\\n',\n59|        count=1,\n60|        run=\"TestRawManifestRefusals/build/credential_forbidden\",\n61|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n62|        note=\"Admits exactly credential into the raw subset; every other excluded class still refuses.\",\n63|    ),\n64|    Mutant(\n65|        name=\"N-raw-order\",\n66|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/rawmanifest.go\",\n67|        find=\"\\tif index > 0 && input.NativeItemKey <= previous {\\n\",\n68|        replace=\"\\tif index > 0 && input.NativeItemKey < previous {\\n\",\n69|        count=1,\n70|        run=\"TestRawManifestRefusals/build/duplicate_entries\",\n71|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n72|        note=\"Admits exactly duplicate keys; unsorted keys still refuse.\",\n73|    ),\n74|    Mutant(\n75|        name=\"N-exclusion-config\",\n76|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/rawmanifest.go\",\n77|        find=\"\\tif hosttrust.ExcludedConfigDirName(key) {\\n\",\n78|        replace='\\tif hosttrust.